  {"data":{"source":"m2","target":"activity","type":"CORRELATES","relation":"leading_indicator","lag":"数月至数个季度","explanation":"广义货币增长可以提前提示后续经济活动所能获得的流动性，但并不决定经济活动的结果。"}},
  {"data":{"source":"ppi","target":"producer-price-pressure","type":"REFLECTS","relation":"synchronous_indicator","lag":"同月","explanation":"PPI 记录工业生产者环节的价格变化，直接反映生产端的价格压力。"}},
  {"data":{"source":"cpi","target":"consumer-price-pressure","type":"REFLECTS","relation":"synchronous_indicator","lag":"同月","explanation":"CPI 记录面向消费者的价格变化，直接反映居民端的价格压力。"}},
  {"data":{"source":"consumer-price-pressure","target":"monetary-policy","type":"AFFECTS","relation":"leading_factor","lag":"数月至数个季度","explanation":"消费价格压力是货币政策决策的重要输入之一，政策响应通常需要经过观察和评估，并同时考虑经济活动、预期及其他条件。"}},
